# Anatomy Study App — PRD (v0)
## Vision
Memorization-first anatomy app with **Learn (no-pressure, Anki-style)** and **Test (XP/coins)** + avatar cosmetics. All body regions unlocked; progress shows via character upgrades.

## Target User
Med/allied-health students needing efficient memorization + motivation.

## Core Loop
Learn → (Again/Hard/Good/Easy) → adaptive resurfacing → Test → XP/coins → Shop → repeat.

## v1 Scope
- Learn Mode: flashcards + labeling with Anki-like scheduling.
- Test Mode: typed, labeling, naming; XP/coins rewards.
- Progress: deck mastery bars, familiarity counts.
- Shop: buy/equip cosmetics; no pay-to-pass.

## Out of Scope (v1)
3D models, social mode, faculty dashboards.

## Success
- D1 retention ≥ 35%, median session 3–6 min, ≥80 reviews/day (active users).
